{"n":1,"turn":0,"phase":"choosing","actions":["switched to Aerodactyl  // Heat Rock means eight turns of sky — I cannot outrun that sun, so I bring in the one thing that can: Aerodactyl resists Fire, holds a Sash, and at +1 it is faster than anything Chlorophyll can build.","switched to Victreebel  // Drought fires the instant the turn opens, so the sky is already mine and Ninetales owes this match nothing else. Victreebel walks in behind eight banked turns of sun wearing a Sash: Alakazam gets one free swing and cannot convert it."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 1 —"},{"type":"ability","side":1,"text":"Ninetales's ability set the weather!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight turned harsh!"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Alakazam, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Aerodactyl!"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Ninetales, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Victreebel!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":1,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(7)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":156,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136},{"name":"Starmie","hp":136,"max_hp":136}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":156,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":2,"turn":1,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Aerodactyl used Stone Edge  // Chlorophyll makes Victreebel faster than my whole roster, so the only question is who eats the hit — and the Sash means Aerodactyl is the one body on this team that cannot be one-shot. Stone Edge is STAB and neutral where Earthquake is neither.","Victreebel used Poison Jab  // Two Sashes on the field means power is worthless this turn and accuracy is everything — no move I own kills through it, so I pick the one that cannot miss. Poison Jab pins Aerodactyl at 1 HP, and a 30% poison roll makes the sky finish the job for me."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 2 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Victreebel used Poison Jab!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Aerodactyl took 50 damage."},{"type":"resisted","side":1,"text":"It's not very effective..."},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Aerodactyl used Stone Edge!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Victreebel took 122 damage."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":2,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(6)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":106,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136},{"name":"Starmie","hp":136,"max_hp":136}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":34,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":3,"turn":2,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Aerodactyl used Stone Edge  // Twenty-one percent left and Stone Edge covers every escape route it has: it finishes Victreebel where it stands, doubles on Ninetales and quadruples on Charizard. There is no switch that makes this the wrong button.","Victreebel used Power Whip  // A Sash is a promise that only holds at full HP, and I broke that promise last turn with a move that could not miss. Now the 15% miss chance is the only thing standing between Aerodactyl and the ground, and Victreebel swings first in my sky."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 3 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Victreebel used Power Whip!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Aerodactyl took 106 damage."},{"type":"faint","side":0,"text":"Aerodactyl fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":3,"phase":"replace","weather":"sun(5)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136},{"name":"Starmie","hp":136,"max_hp":136}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":34,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":4,"turn":3,"phase":"replace","actions":["switched to Starmie  // Aerodactyl bought me 79% of a Victreebel and the read that it is Jolly-max — which puts it at 268 in the sun, six points under Scarf Starmie. Six points is the whole margin I have left, and it is enough.",""],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Starmie!"}],"after":{"turn":3,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(5)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136},{"name":"Starmie","hp":136,"max_hp":136,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":34,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":5,"turn":3,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Starmie used Ice Beam  // Both my Psychic and my Ice kill Victreebel from 18%, so I pick the lock, not the kill — Ice Beam doubles on every Chlorophyll Grass they own, and this team is made of Grass.","Victreebel used Sucker Punch  // A Scarf Starmie outruns even doubled Chlorophyll, so Victreebel does not get to be fast — it gets to be first. Sucker Punch is super-effective on the Psychic half and lands before the reply: I am spending a Pokémon that is already spent to take 80% of Starmie with it."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 4 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Victreebel used Sucker Punch!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Starmie took 104 damage."},{"type":"effective","side":1,"text":"It's super effective!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Starmie used Ice Beam!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Victreebel took 34 damage."},{"type":"effective","side":0,"text":"It's super effective!"},{"type":"status","side":1,"text":"Victreebel was frozen solid!"},{"type":"faint","side":1,"text":"Victreebel fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":4,"phase":"replace","weather":"sun(4)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136},{"name":"Starmie","hp":32,"max_hp":136,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":6,"turn":4,"phase":"replace","actions":["","switched to Arcanine  // Starmie bought its speed with a Scarf and paid for it with its moveset — it is welded to Ice Beam, which a Fire-type laughs at. Arcanine walks in resistant, drops their Attack on the way, and answers 275 Speed with a Banded Extreme Speed that does not care about Speed at all."],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Arcanine!"},{"type":"ability","side":1,"text":"Arcanine's Intimidate cuts Starmie's Attack!"},{"type":"stat","side":0,"text":"Starmie's Attack fell!"}],"after":{"turn":4,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(4)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136},{"name":"Starmie","hp":32,"max_hp":136,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":7,"turn":4,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Starmie used Ice Beam  // Starmie is at 32 and locked into the one move Arcanine resists — it is already spent. So I spend it deliberately: chip damage now, and more importantly Arcanine picks its Choice lock this turn, which tells me whether Dugtrio walks in and traps it or has to fear priority.","Arcanine used Extreme Speed  // This engine gives Fire-types no immunity to freeze, so letting Starmie click Ice Beam is a 10% coin flip on losing Arcanine to an ice cube for nothing. Extreme Speed removes the coin from the table: +2 priority, 30 HP left, done before the Scarf matters."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 5 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Arcanine used Extreme Speed!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Starmie took 32 damage."},{"type":"faint","side":0,"text":"Starmie fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":5,"phase":"replace","weather":"sun(3)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":8,"turn":5,"phase":"replace","actions":["switched to Electrode  // Extreme Speed at +2 priority makes my whole creed irrelevant — the fastest team in the arena does not get to move. So this stops being about speed and becomes about who can eat one hit: Electrode has the thickest Defence I own and the least to offer against Grass. It buys the turn.",""],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Electrode!"}],"after":{"turn":5,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(3)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136,"active":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":171,"max_hp":171},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":9,"turn":5,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Electrode used Thunderbolt  // Arcanine has no choice but Extreme Speed, so I have no choice but to out-live it. If Electrode stands up, Thunderbolt puts a Choice-locked Arcanine to half — and a banded dog at half HP gets recalled, which is the only way I ever get to move first again.","switched to Exeggutor  // Arcanine is welded to a move that leaves Electrode alive, and a wasted turn against this team is how you lose a Pokémon. Exeggutor resists the Electric STAB, clears 211 Speed by three points under my sun, and turns a two-turn Solar Beam into a one-turn execution."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 6 —"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Arcanine, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Exeggutor!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Electrode used Thunderbolt!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Exeggutor took 38 damage."},{"type":"resisted","side":0,"text":"It's not very effective..."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."},{"type":"item","side":1,"text":"Exeggutor restored a little HP (Leftovers, +10)."}],"after":{"turn":6,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(2)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136,"active":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":143,"max_hp":171,"active":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":10,"turn":6,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Electrode used Signal Beam  // That Leftovers tick was exactly ten — 170 HP, no bulk investment, a pure sun sweeper. It outspeeds me, but Grass/Psychic is four times weak to Bug and Electrode is carrying an Expert Belt Signal Beam. I do not need to be faster this turn, only alive.","Exeggutor used Solar Beam  // Under my sky Solar Beam has no charge turn — it is a 120-power move that fires like a 60-power one, and Electrode has 135 HP to hide behind. This is the whole thesis of the team in a single click."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 7 —"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Electrode used Signal Beam!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Exeggutor took 143 damage."},{"type":"effective","side":0,"text":"It's super effective!"},{"type":"faint","side":1,"text":"Exeggutor fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":7,"phase":"replace","weather":"sun(1)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136,"active":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":11,"turn":7,"phase":"replace","actions":["","switched to Arcanine  // I misread Electrode's Speed and it cost me Exeggutor — so I stop trying to outrun it and start trying to outweigh it. Arcanine has one turn of sun left and a Banded Flare Blitz worth two and a half Electrodes: no accuracy roll, no Speed check, no argument."],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Arcanine!"},{"type":"ability","side":1,"text":"Arcanine's Intimidate cuts Electrode's Attack!"},{"type":"stat","side":0,"text":"Electrode's Attack fell!"}],"after":{"turn":7,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(1)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":136,"max_hp":136,"active":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":166,"max_hp":166,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":12,"turn":7,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Electrode used Thunderbolt  // Electrode has already paid for itself, so I spend it buying the read. If Arcanine clicks Flare Blitz it locks into a priority-zero move and takes a third of it back as recoil — and then Dugtrio walks in, traps it, and out-speeds it. Thunderbolt lands first either way.","Arcanine used Flare Blitz  // Last turn of sunlight, spent on the biggest number I own: Band times STAB times Drought is 357 damage into a 136 HP Pokémon. Electrode built itself to delete something before it moves — it just met the one thing on my roster that does not need to move first."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 8 —"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Electrode used Thunderbolt!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Arcanine took 80 damage."},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Arcanine used Flare Blitz!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Electrode took 136 damage."},{"type":"crit","side":1,"text":"A critical hit!"},{"type":"recoil","side":1,"text":"Arcanine is hit with recoil! (-45)"},{"type":"faint","side":0,"text":"Electrode fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight faded."}],"after":{"turn":8,"phase":"replace","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":41,"max_hp":166,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":13,"turn":8,"phase":"replace","actions":["switched to Dugtrio  // The sky is out and the dog is locked into a priority-zero move at 24 percent. Arena Trap closes the door behind it — Solaris does not get to recall Arcanine and reset that Extreme Speed. Dugtrio moves first, and Ground doubles on Fire.",""],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Dugtrio!"}],"after":{"turn":8,"phase":"choosing","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111,"active":true},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":41,"max_hp":166,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":14,"turn":8,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Dugtrio used Earthquake  // Trapped, locked, and out-sped. Band Earthquake is STAB and doubled on Fire — this is the whole reason Dugtrio was on the sheet.","Arcanine used Flare Blitz  // Arena Trap plus my own Choice Band leaves me precisely one legal action, which is a tidy piece of work by them. Arcanine swings anyway: 306 damage into a 110 HP Dugtrio if it lives long enough to throw it, and a Fire-type that dies mid-punch is still a Fire-type that punched."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 9 —"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Dugtrio used Earthquake!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Arcanine took 41 damage."},{"type":"effective","side":0,"text":"It's super effective!"},{"type":"faint","side":1,"text":"Arcanine fainted!"}],"after":{"turn":9,"phase":"replace","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111,"active":true},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":0,"max_hp":166,"fainted":true,"active":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":15,"turn":9,"phase":"replace","actions":["","switched to Charizard  // Arena Trap holds everything that touches the ground, and a Banded Earthquake is only terrifying to things standing on it. Charizard does neither: it is immune to the trap, immune to the move, and the only Pokémon on either side that gets to treat Dugtrio as furniture."],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Charizard!"}],"after":{"turn":9,"phase":"choosing","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":141,"max_hp":141},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111,"active":true},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154,"active":true},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":0,"max_hp":166,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":16,"turn":9,"phase":"choosing","actions":["switched to Jolteon  // Solar Power with no sun is just a liability, and Heavy-Duty Boots tell me they feared hazards, not me. Dugtrio is locked into a move a Flying-type laughs at, so I bring the answer: Jolteon eats the Fire Blast, then Specs Thunderbolt doubles on Flying for twice Charizard's health.","Charizard used Fire Blast  // Dugtrio is welded to a move that reads zero against a Flying-type, so this is the rarest thing in a glass-cannon match: a completely free turn. I spend it on the biggest button — Fire Blast is 132 into a 110 HP trapper, and 15% miss chance costs me nothing but time I am not paying for."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 10 —"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Dugtrio, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Jolteon!"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Charizard used Fire Blast!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Jolteon took 94 damage."}],"after":{"turn":10,"phase":"choosing","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":47,"max_hp":141,"active":true},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":149,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154,"active":true},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":0,"max_hp":166,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":17,"turn":10,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Jolteon used Thunderbolt  // Forty-seven HP is plenty when you only need one turn. Fire/Flying into a Choice Specs Thunderbolt is the single worst square on the board, and Jolteon gets there first.","switched to Ninetales  // Jolteon and Dugtrio are a pincer: one outruns Charizard, the other traps and one-shots everything else I own. Ninetales does not need to beat either of them — it needs to walk in, survive one neutral Thunderbolt, and hand Venusaur 264 Speed, which outruns the whole pincer at once. Eight turns of sky is worth whatever Ninetales pays for it."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 11 —"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Charizard, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Ninetales!"},{"type":"ability","side":1,"text":"Ninetales's ability set the weather!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight turned harsh!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Jolteon used Thunderbolt!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Ninetales took 118 damage."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":11,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(7)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":47,"max_hp":141,"active":true},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":31,"max_hp":149,"active":true},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":156,"max_hp":156},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":0,"max_hp":166,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":18,"turn":11,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Jolteon used Thunderbolt  // Nineteen percent. Killing Ninetales does not switch the sun off, but it means this is the last sky Solaris ever gets — and the same locked Thunderbolt doubles on Charizard if they run. Jolteon is at 47 and does not need a 48th.","switched to Venusaur  // The sky is bought and paid for — eight turns, and Ninetales lives at 31 to sell it again if it must. Venusaur now enters at 264 Speed, resisting Jolteon's STAB, faster than Jolteon and faster than Dugtrio: whichever half of the pincer they pick, it moves second."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 12 —"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Ninetales, come back!"},{"type":"switch","side":1,"text":"Go, Venusaur!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Jolteon used Thunderbolt!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Venusaur took 62 damage."},{"type":"resisted","side":0,"text":"It's not very effective..."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":12,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(6)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":47,"max_hp":141,"active":true},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":31,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":94,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":0,"max_hp":166,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":19,"turn":12,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Jolteon used Thunderbolt  // Venusaur at 290 in the sun outruns everything I have, so Alakazam cannot walk in — it has to be carried in over a body, because a replacement after a faint enters untouched. Jolteon is at 47 and locked into the one move Grass resists. It gets one last Thunderbolt and then it buys Alakazam a free entry.","Venusaur used Giga Drain  // Giga Drain is the move that is correct against both halves of the pincer at once: lethal on Jolteon, doubly lethal on a Dugtrio that switches in, and it pays me back HP either way. Against a team that has to move first to matter, I would rather heal while I kill than kill a little harder."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 13 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Venusaur used Giga Drain!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Jolteon took 47 damage."},{"type":"heal","side":1,"text":"Venusaur restored 24 HP."},{"type":"faint","side":0,"text":"Jolteon fainted!"},{"type":"item","side":1,"text":"Venusaur was hurt by its Life Orb! (-15)"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":13,"phase":"replace","weather":"sun(5)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":31,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":103,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":0,"max_hp":166,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":20,"turn":13,"phase":"replace","actions":["switched to Alakazam  // Life Orb recoil of exactly fifteen prices Venusaur at 155 max HP and marks it as an all-in attacker with no bulk. It hits harder than I thought but not hard enough: Alakazam survives Giga Drain or Sludge Bomb and answers with a doubled Psychic worth two and a half times what is left of it.",""],"lines":[{"type":"switch","side":0,"text":"Go, Alakazam!"}],"after":{"turn":13,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(5)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131,"active":true},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":31,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":103,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":0,"max_hp":166,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":21,"turn":13,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Alakazam used Psychic  // Magic Guard means the only thing that touches Alakazam is the hit itself, and Venusaur's does not finish the job. Psychic doubles on Grass/Poison — I take one and delete it.","Venusaur used Sleep Powder  // Venusaur outruns Alakazam by 75 points and still cannot kill it in one, which means trading damage here just loses politely. So I take the 75% instead of the 100% that ends with me dead: Sleep Powder is the only move on this team that turns a losing race into no race at all."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 14 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Venusaur used Sleep Powder!"},{"type":"status","side":0,"text":"Alakazam was put to sleep!"},{"type":"status","side":0,"text":"Alakazam is fast asleep."},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":14,"phase":"choosing","weather":"sun(4)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":131,"max_hp":131,"status":"sleep","active":true},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":31,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":103,"max_hp":156,"active":true},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},{"name":"Charizard","hp":154,"max_hp":154},{"name":"Arcanine","hp":0,"max_hp":166,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"}]},"winner":-1}
{"n":22,"turn":14,"phase":"choosing","actions":["Alakazam used Psychic  // Sleep only counts down when you try to move, so running away costs me the turn and the counter both. Alakazam is at full and lives through exactly one Giga Drain — so it stands there, takes it, and if it opens its eyes Venusaur is gone. This is the coin flip the Sleep Powder bought them.","Venusaur used Sludge Bomb  // Sleep here is a loan, not a gift — this engine rolls 2-4 turns and it has already spent one, so there is a one-in-three chance Alakazam opens its eyes this turn. Greed says Growth; arithmetic says bank 115 damage now, so that even the branch where it wakes up leaves it on 16 HP instead of full."],"lines":[{"type":"turn","side":-1,"text":"— Turn 15 —"},{"type":"move","side":1,"text":"Venusaur used Sludge Bomb!"},{"type":"damage","side":0,"text":"Alakazam took 99 damage."},{"type":"item","side":1,"text":"Venusaur was hurt by its Life Orb! (-15)"},{"type":"status","side":0,"text":"Alakazam woke up!"},{"type":"move","side":0,"text":"Alakazam used Psychic!"},{"type":"damage","side":1,"text":"Venusaur took 88 damage."},{"type":"effective","side":0,"text":"It's super effective!"},{"type":"faint","side":1,"text":"Venusaur fainted!"},{"type":"weather","side":-1,"text":"The sunlight is strong."}],"after":{"turn":15,"phase":"replace","weather":"sun(3)","sides":[{"trainer":"Hairtrigger","team":[{"name":"Alakazam","hp":32,"max_hp":131,"active":true},{"name":"Jolteon","hp":0,"max_hp":141,"fainted":true},{"name":"Aerodactyl","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Dugtrio","hp":111,"max_hp":111},{"name":"Electrode","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true},{"name":"Starmie","hp":0,"max_hp":136,"fainted":true}],"hazards":"none","screens":"none"},{"trainer":"Solaris","team":[{"name":"Ninetales","hp":31,"max_hp":149},{"name":"Venusaur","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true,"active":true},{"name":"Victreebel","hp":0,"max_hp":156,"fainted":true},{"name":"Exeggutor","hp":0,"max_hp":171,"fainted":true},